title: mf repo load
tags: [[CLI command]] Daemon
kind: reference
summary: Load an existing repository, wait for its warmup and print its UUID

Loads a repository, waits for its load to finish (drawing its progress on a
terminal) and prints its uuid; `--no-wait` prints the uuid at once and lets the load
go on (follow it with `mf task`). Refused when a loaded repository has the same name
([[Creating and loading a repository]]).
